Glvbi5kcmVzcy51cBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Doll Dress Up: Fashion Star, the ultimate fashion playground where your creativity knows no bounds! Design, collect, and battle with your dream dolls in a world of endless style possibilities.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ UNLIMITED DRESS UP\\u003cbr\\u003eNo limits, just pure fashion! Customize your dolls from scratch. Select different genders, diverse skin tones, glamorous makeup, and hundreds of clothing concepts. Style without boundaries and build a magnificent collection of unique dolls.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 CHOOSE LEFT OR RIGHT: THE STYLE DUEL!\\u003cbr\\u003ePut your style instincts to the test in our signature fashion battle! Go head-to-head against other players, let the system score your look, and see who claims the title of Style Queen or King!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e• No limits: Total freedom over gender, skin, and makeup 💄\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fun Left or Right decision-making gameplay 💖\\u003cbr\\u003e• A vast collection of styles to unlock and master 👗\\u003cbr\\u003e• Exciting automated scoring system to crown the winner 🏆\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now and win the duel!\"],\"CozyTap Studio\",\"10,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VIHqAFmPoTSePQe9WorqXrvh81sfN9-C8pVeyTREqDV2Tk9hjAGkUBQN0tB50L6lh0cYIb8_FfUpO9C9QmnE\"],null,[247,179,235,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"เหมาะสมสำหรับทุกกลุ่มอายุ มีความรุนแรงได้เล็กน้อยในบริบทที่ตลกขบขันหรือแฟนตาซี ห้ามไม่ให้มีภาษาที่หยาบคาย\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play