BJ4kUB9xPC4_blHgw14rfPT_dOMNVWxfxzURJ_CO5VIIhwEln0TyTEnUbRP4Dy6ynh297ayvOSgpcrxfLL6he3wayT8F179Upu9suqAS6fhPAFdnSVSzcTSsRVsOlu4uw1Qk76ujiOdNwIphuq3btopJXqgHsQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3pu8nD2q5IE/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to Hole.io, the wildly satisfying eat-the-world game played by millions! Drop into busy New York, a creaky pirate cove, or a glowing sci-fi metropolis - and swallow it whole. Cars, lampposts, hot dogs and even giant skyscrapers! 🏙️🏴\\u200d☠️🚀\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;ve got five minutes while watching your favorite show or an hour to unwind before bed, just tap, glide, and watch the city crumble into a black hole. No pressure, no stress - just the pure, oddly relaxing joy of eating everything in sight. 😌\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🍔 EAT EVERYTHING\\u003cbr\\u003eStart tiny, barely big enough to swallow a trash can. Grow huge, big enough to gulp down skyscrapers in one bite. The bigger you get, the louder the crunch. Pure satisfaction. 🌆\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😌 THE PERFECT BREAK \\u003cbr\\u003eEasy to learn, instantly satisfying. Play in short bursts: morning coffee ☕, lunch break 🥪, evening unwind🌙. A relaxing, oddly soothing game for casual players.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ WHY YOU\\u0026#39;LL LOVE IT \\u003cbr\\u003e- Wonderfully simple controls - just swipe and glide.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Insanely satisfying gameplay - swallow, smash, and clear the map.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Beautiful, vibrant 3D worlds packed with detail.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Free to play, easy to love.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🕳️ Ready to swallow the world? Download Hole.io now and find out why millions of players can\\u0026#39;t put it down. Time to feed the black hole. 😋\"],\"VOODOO\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cGXxPboiwvp6F7LPPGQxDyUbrUL2_PbSAZnj3erVs9QpdRCpqWYz-LZBbBoBb2Tbg8Yh0R6Z7Ujr84BaJXHC\"],null,[239,182,132,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"ความรุนแรงโดยนัย\"],[null,\"การซื้อในเกม\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dio.voodoo.holeio\\u0026rdid\\u003dio.voodoo.holeio\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"ติดตั้ง\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"฿31.00 - ฿3,050.00 ต่อรายการ\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"เล่นฆ่าเวลา\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.media720.games2020\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rgxlkDr9t_Nxjo0ojkGNdfsxRxEdZxEjZw6_vlDq9BBEhvOgX5SG-qg4cPF6_RrETPRpTF67HPI-iSG7O-RjzQ\"],null,[250,250,250,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/tVRHQtwJw18ddfp1ok3WkceumhLMgGRPm88lntvqh_iNJjTcEOHvFXnyuldches49pSAaLXZhL8R_BnAt57veA\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OtlLXEO9IGxJ9aPaxMAOvrSYqDy7MAGp3gYT1QpVjsev6F4xvPcOn0z-9BtX8cCRBvWk_ACGKpk13ZGaFb29BQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aZIPjYotYTjGKNw3QCagagX5pEWJOThkCWudIPeI2nfcfZm2uqVBlzAPCHP2yFKwvp3jKCKbJELrTvWHT0BDNg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2GNiP4aZIFTLPEavsDw0BmK0_Y64rJ1QuHXnb3SQ8kV6EYqFi-bgWeBAOPiNx1irnqpjeunet1CwEMzavotl\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/64XNB1RDxH04xw_ez9TbwpVNolI0cMZBf3Iwa3aHPt8YpUyijayQ3ru3FNTvAaL9qQa-oHnXcCV-BIuvwljQQQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ouaKKGHkE2dVX76ocZVdUjVNDrzjnvd2BOwQEJFV4wmqg452sqsJly2e8KLhAnwC0RfQ90DkLvYS8MU2bkFreA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GdGBu4havrvquHJfCqMB41EAbQj5G8MroR_uu1hXegIHTurrRzeM0wvYjJRHlWDnhmiUZk84In7HQWy6ke3p_98\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2rblLrpb5silrLhRLq249IM7cKem2e-jwFWvqOQwtaGcvyK_Pr6LbUcdAii4FzptHGEqnIshtuYY4vfW_303\"]]],\"เกมไม่ใช้เน็ต เกมออฟไลน์ 10000\",[\"4.7\",4.6780305],\"เล่นฆ่าเวลา\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.media720.games2020\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.media720.games2020\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.media720.games2020\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIBkoTCMOWlLDHkJcDFZ3ncwEd2QAY9PoBDAoKCAASBgoCdGgQALoCOAocChZjb20ubWVkaWE3MjAuZ2FtZXMyMDIwEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"3EygjIm1veQ\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:3EygjIm1veQ?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:3EygjIm1veQ\",null,[1280,720],null,null,\"AXH1ezn5C3XbxOP_V83FZOwRmuUo7FWs2MwrATh6hrr1obWSIVTqDn5WkgbGMtNXnE6EKyhA-yk8DfEWW_U4vIo2rDvnvastKBdKPsHkfYYQ6NuCJxi-vxnjeLmOkIFU9var75TwIvU50ZiODnXogpArnAv_mruH21zBokGngzHNr5KX4Yb5NC9njb1hVwmTdzJ7Vu2FuC7D5LWW7rqhAHdYFZH8UwsetMOZbXfREgfbjIYBPe2NToYUje-eNZ9p1VgdF6NkC8Oj4g3XSq0fh988Kb-Oartye05JsY3UWdZaAglfRg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3EygjIm1veQ/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Offline Games No WiFi Puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eLooking for engaging offline entertainment? \\u0026quot;Offline Games No WiFi\\u0026quot; is your ultimate destination for fun, challenging, and mind-bending puzzles that require no internet connection. Dive into a world where you can enjoy hours of entertainment with no WiFi needed, perfect for any situation where you want to pass the time with engaging offline challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVariety of Challenges: Explore a vast collection of puzzles, including block blast, solitaire, and many more.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo WiFi Needed: Enjoy the game anywhere, anytime, without an internet connection.\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenging Levels: Test your brain with levels designed to challenge and entertain.\\u003cbr\\u003eRegular Updates: Stay engaged with new puzzles and challenges added regularly.\\u003cbr\\u003eUser-Friendly Interface: Navigate through the game with ease thanks to its intuitive design.\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy Choose Offline Games No WiFi?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOffline Play: Enjoy seamless gameplay without worrying about internet connectivity. Perfect for long trips, commutes, or when you\\u0026#39;re in areas with limited internet access.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNo WiFi Fun: Our game is designed to provide endless fun and entertainment without the need for WiFi. It\\u0026#39;s a great way to relax and enjoy your free time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePopular Puzzles: From classic games like solitaire to exciting new challenges like block blast, we have something for everyone. Our puzzles are designed to be fun and engaging for all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEntertainment: Our game offers a variety of challenges that cater to all types of players. Whether you love strategy, logic, or casual games, we have it all.\\u003cbr\\u003eGolf and Solitaire: Not only do we provide classic solitaire puzzles, but also fun variations of golf-themed challenges for an added twist.\\u003cbr\\u003eBlock Blast: One of our most popular features, block blast puzzles are sure to keep you entertained for hours.\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin the Community:\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin millions of players worldwide who are already enjoying \\u0026quot;Offline Games No WiFi Puzzles\\u0026quot;. Share your progress, challenge your friends, and see who can solve the puzzles the fastest.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOffline Entertainment with High-Quality Graphics:\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience stunning graphics and smooth animations that bring each puzzle to life. Our game is designed to provide the finest visual experience even without an internet connection.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Benefits:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNo Data Usage: Save your mobile data for other important things while you enjoy our offline entertainment.\\u003cbr\\u003eBattery Friendly: Our game is optimized to consume less battery, allowing you to play longer without draining your device.\\u003cbr\\u003eAccessible Anywhere: Whether you\\u0026#39;re on a plane, a train, or just at home with no WiFi, you can always enjoy our challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003eStart Your Adventure:\\u003cbr\\u003eEmbark on a puzzle-solving journey that you can enjoy anywhere. \\u0026quot;Offline Games No WiFi Puzzles\\u0026quot; offers an exciting array of challenges that cater to all ages and preferences. With new puzzles added regularly, there is always something fresh to discover.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Get the Most Out of Our Game:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStay Updated: Make sure to download the latest updates for new puzzles and features.\\u003cbr\\u003eEngage with Friends: Challenge your friends and family to see who can solve puzzles faster.\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore Different Modes: Try various game modes to keep your puzzle-solving experience diverse and exciting.\\u003cbr\\u003eConnect with Us:\\u003cbr\\u003eStay updated with the latest news and updates.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload \\u0026quot;Offline Games No WiFi Puzzles\\u0026quot; today and experience offline gaming. No WiFi, no problem!\"],\"Fun Offline Games\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jQIZhxT6cZt9DVh0Ev2BUIQaQ-EJ4EjcgT3WAvy7arb-r7q19A2rW2O-_FMWpwL7_cqEVlYouujGjZuAZv14\"],null,[118,120,121,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"ความรุนแรงน้อย\"],[null,\"การซื้อในเกม\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.media720.games2020\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.media720.games2020\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"ติดตั้ง\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"฿39.00 - ฿200.00 ต่อรายการ\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"เล่นฆ่าเวลา\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.outfit7.mytalkingtom2\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,