oogle.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:E3abyOPHdDE?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:E3abyOPHdDE\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznlMsQNSCD8xlYSeNGwU1S6WEoDACEMZ3-spDISo7l2Cvm9euCdix1zxdyVEigDVkaOmNH9RoODU0o9f-jTBMGT5eA--HQnEmU2VNJsWpgh33OlJq_y2SpQZQ_MtyTAu6haxAW-mwI7nAmoh4HUJXoW5wUZNKst7X4qHQTsgeoIhhti42BUPWv_ref3OrZEi8Cd0Zps861VH09zlyucfnSdmM1MLuTIx9oQHKg9EBfvLYuiJbR3AJU5GZNwkVA8qJFgoKllPzwlyTZvZHPZvOaZzQSbPC6re_UgfMeVmcz7fA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/E3abyOPHdDE/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Have you played Fish Eater? Take a deep breath and delve down into an underwater world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou start as an ordinary fish.\\u003cbr\\u003eYour goal is to battle, eat, grow, and evolve!\\u003cbr\\u003eUntil you are the Lord of the Sea and have conquered all!\\u003cbr\\u003eMerge, evolve, grow in power, and devour your foes!\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore the depths, fight sharks, and take your place at the top of the food chain!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan YOU become the true overlord of the ocean?!\"],\"Tap 2 Fun\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Osu4rByBzsf1354O2O5__Fs4rctClGPad2bKE4WssK0R2UecltIeNKVA_gvLVCOAnW7doyh1IwJ5wrsFCP6g4A\"],null,[28,154,236,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"การซื้อในเกม\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null