GIO3XsBdDMF7ot8euw\"]],[null,2,[2208,1242],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2Y999FUuGd6vjXGjtR8FQdfh8399MO9tCE5YNyeertiflq_MZEUnnN9YvRMLfXniwDO2eMvpxESTJ8QZ7YZTwrE\"]]],\"My Talking Angela\",[\"4.3\",4.337625],\"เล่นฆ่าเวลา\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangelafree\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangelafree\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangelafree\"]],[\"qgJsGmoIMUoTCMOWlLDHkJcDFZ3ncwEd2QAY9PoBDAoKCAASBgoCdGgQAboCQQolCh9jb20ub3V0Zml0Ny5teXRhbGtpbmdhbmdlbGFmcmVlEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Talking Angela is the super fun virtual star who can’t wait to dance and sing her way to the top.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlayers help her stay happy and busy with day-to-day activities in her 3D world:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Stylish makeup looks\\u003cbr\\u003e- Wonderful wardrobe choices\\u003cbr\\u003e- Super sweet activities\\u003cbr\\u003e- Special sticker albums\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eShe’s interactive. She’s customizable. She’s fun. And she’s always ready to make new friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom the creators of My Talking Tom, My Talking Tom 2 and My Talking Tom Friends comes the pet who’s a star in the making.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app contains:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Promotion of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s products and advertising;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Links that direct customers to Outfit7’s websites and other apps;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Personalization of content to encourage users to play the app again;\\u003cbr\\u003e- YouTube integration to allow users to watch videos of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s animated characters;\\u003cbr\\u003e- The option to make in-app purchases;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Subscriptions which automatically renew at the end of a subscription period unless cancelled. You can manage and cancel your subscription any time via Settings in your Google Play account;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Items to purchase (available in different prices) using virtual currency, depending on the player’s progress;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Alternative options to access all functionalities of the app without making any in-app purchases using real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/eula/en/\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy for games: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/privacy-policy-games/en\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer support: support@outfit7.com\"],\"Outfit7 Limited\",\"1,000,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/bdNHZ9qChYI2QTcgjepYZLMYx378R1xC8uAO2GiTyB7pbyICtgcmUb2feO4ItlYKDssLjpHbbIz0AG5uWX1IqA\"],null,[88,33,80,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"การซื้อในเกม\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangelafree\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingangelafree\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"ติดตั้ง\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"฿32.79 - ฿3,310.89 ต่อรายการ\",[false]]]