e/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.hp.prison.runner3d.obby.parkour\"]],[\"qgJwGm4IM0oTCMOWlLDHkJcDFZ3ncwEd2QAY9PoBDAoKCAASBgoCdGgQAboCRQopCiNjb20uaHAucHJpc29uLnJ1bm5lcjNkLm9iYnkucGFya291chABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Get ready for one of the most thrilling and addictive parkour games you\\u0026#39;ll ever play! In this vibrant and challenging world of Obby Parkour, your mission is simple yet exciting—run, jump, and slide through wild obstacle courses filled with traps and moving platforms. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 How to Play:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Swipe to run, jump, and slide through each course\\u003cbr\\u003e- Avoid traps and obstacles with perfect timing\\u003cbr\\u003e- Finish levels to unlock new challenges and game modes\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Smooth controls \\u0026amp; realistic parkour mechanics\\u003cbr\\u003e- Bright, colorful 3D graphics with immersive designs\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hundreds of creative levels and maps to explore\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unique game modes: Color Block, Obby Lava, Prison Escape, Hide n Seek, and more\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚀 So, are you ready to take on this challenge? Download and dive into the colorful world of Obby Parkour now!\"],\"FG Game Studios\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vMbGkYC8cmi97eoyj4YSayYDwFWlaF6FaMlvDwnTHTr-l45RIJqN94tnMfLWV7HzljNX7JYZhyeK0FdFLYLM\"],null,[177,233,255,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"การซื้อในเกม\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSp