ull,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkinghank\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkinghank\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkinghank\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIN0oTCMOWlLDHkJcDFZ3ncwEd2QAY9PoBDAoKCAASBgoCdGgQAboCOwofChljb20ub3V0Zml0Ny5teXRhbGtpbmdoYW5rEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],[[[null,null,\"Y8kTSNRNbVM\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:Y8kTSNRNbVM?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:Y8kTSNRNbVM\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezkNTfA_xQK409OQnXiIosl_BHwrdCZvoY3TH8s20Wj3KdDjp5EShzh43h4WAfkAOC92stUucRmfmYJYs2pT-WI3_b3UBMXR84_8lwIqd_6Nz8YjAro-7oscGsWFS6Ylypz-bT1lIiYYjdB0VSrboEgxdRjxYKw5XbyxWndxk5SDeT_ArAmYMNMau2IvTuuxIdHn4W3P81_Pet-_-dreu9F_XiqWrXVtP2VH9xmwx7KUAnemNwQ47Wh5cWC5Ld6IwQyhMzN0W8YJBKfxyQJAF0tJNFLyqbG3O6Navp5je_tXgA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Y8kTSNRNbVM/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Meet Hank on an island adventure full of places to explore, animals to discover, and rewards to bring home. Travel across colorful island areas, uncover hidden paths, collect stickers, and return to Hank\\u0026#39;s treehouse base to decorate, upgrade, and get ready for the next trip.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEXPLORE HANK\\u0026#39;S ISLANDS\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into bright island worlds made for discovery. Explore beaches, jungles, icy areas and hidden paths as you search for new activities, rewards and surprises. Ride ziplines, travel by boat, swim through tropical waters and uncover island adventures with Hank by your side.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDISCOVER ISLAND ANIMALS\\u003cbr\\u003eMeet wild animals across the islands and discover what makes each one special. Find a friendly lion, sea turtles and other island creatures as you explore. Collect stickers and play animal mini-games, from styling a lion\\u0026#39;s mane to looking at the stars through outdoor telescopes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFIND, COLLECT AND UNLOCK\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery island trip gives Hank something new to bring home:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Explore beaches, jungles, icy places and hidden paths\\u003cbr\\u003e- Discover wildlife and meet island animals\\u003cbr\\u003e- Collect stickers for Hank\\u0026#39;s album\\u003cbr\\u003e- Unlock explorer outfits and treehouse items\\u003cbr\\u003e- Travel by zipline, boat and through tropical waters\\u003cbr\\u003e- Return to Hank\\u0026#39;s treehouse base between adventures\\u003cbr\\u003e- Play offline, anywhere\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUPGRADE HANK\\u0026#39;S TREEHOUSE BASE\\u003cbr\\u003eBring rewards back from your island adventures and use them to upgrade Hank\\u0026#39;s treehouse. Decorate his home, unlock new items and make a cozy base for your next island trip.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePLAY ISLAND MINI-GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003eTake on light, animal-themed activities across the islands. Try a lion hair salon, trace stars with a telescope, join a penguin snowball fight and discover more playful challenges as you explore.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRECHARGE FOR THE NEXT ADVENTURE\\u003cbr\\u003eHank is your island dog and adventure buddy. After a day of exploring, help him recharge with quick care moments so he is ready for another day of tropical discovery.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWHY PLAY?\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore island areas, discover animals, collect stickers, play mini-games, unlock explorer outfits and upgrade Hank\\u0026#39;s treehouse base. Start your island adventure today.\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom Outfit7, creators of the hit family-friendly mobile games My Talking Angela 2, My Talking Tom 2, and My Talking Tom Friends.\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app contains:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Promotion of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s products and advertising;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Links that direct customers to Outfit7’s websites and other apps;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Personalization of content to encourage users to play the app again;\\u003cbr\\u003e- The option to make in-app purchases;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Items to purchase (available in different prices) using virtual currency, depending on the player’s progress;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Alternative options to access all functionalities of the app without making any in-app purchases using real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/eula/en/\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy for games: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/privacy-policy-games/en\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer support: support@outfit7.com\"],\"Outfit7 Limited\",\"100,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B-RfMMgOmrj9skYcJPoUlzQ-o35987RvSEROBL4FGnuRUFDmdsbkUvqn14CQOmG2YuXCPrCN5fL9-VBi9tTYXmI\"],null,[234,245,250,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"การซื้อในเกม\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkinghank\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkinghank\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"ติดตั้ง\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],[\"฿100.99 - ฿507.19 ต่อรายการ\",[false]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null