03d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.jmg.the.buddy.battles\"]],[\"qgJmGmQIOkoTCMOWlLDHkJcDFZ3ncwEd2QAY9PoBDAoKCAASBgoCdGgQAboCOwofChljb20uam1nLnRoZS5idWRkeS5iYXR0bGVzEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Get ready to explore a dual style game where you can play with friends or face a robotic opponent. The main aim of these dual player games is to keep you engaged whenever you have free time and make your moments more entertaining.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose from a collection of fun mini games and test your skills in quick one on one battles. Compete in ping pong, penalty kicks, tic tac toe, bowling, and more, all on a single device. Challenge your friends to be the last standing player in the ring as a SUMO.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re playing alone or with a friend, don’t worry, you can beat the robot, challenge your buddies as well, and show off your mini game skills!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay anytime, anywhere, and switch between multiplayer and solo mode with just a tap. Each mini game offers a simple way to relax, challenge, and enjoy friendly duels or solo action.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDuel Player Games Quality Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYou have too much to do on a small screen.\\u003cbr\\u003eTwo players can play using the same device.\\u003cbr\\u003ePush your opponent outside the stage.\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenge your friends with multiple challenging games.\"],\"Just Make Games\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/PmKeUzttOgjTGePIYNS4Unwe_o6hjMu7X1qd430iy17scWHJDnzfOEXP47b8OVl7vLkFO4Ki3zvB-kwNkrMiG6Q\"],null,[162,220,254,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"ความ