CbAl3p\"]]],\"Plug Runner\",[\"3.7\",3.6571429],\"เล่นฆ่าเวลา\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery.mates\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery.mates\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery.mates\"]],[\"qgJqGmgIQkoTCMOWlLDHkJcDFZ3ncwEd2QAY9PoBDAoKCAASBgoCdGgQAboCPwojCh1jb20ucGx1Zy5ydW5uZXIuYmF0dGVyeS5tYXRlcxABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"⚡ Get ready for the most electrifying race of your life! ⚡\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to Plug Runner, the ultimate racing game where energy is everything! Take control of your plug character, charge up, and dash your way to victory in this highly addictive and fun competition! 🏃\\u200d♂️💨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔋 COLLECT \\u0026amp; GROW HUGE!\\u003cbr\\u003eRun across the track and collect batteries that match your color. The more you collect, the bigger and stronger you become! \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🚤 POWER UP VEHICLES \\u0026amp; OVERCOME OBSTACLES!\\u003cbr\\u003eYou\\u0026#39;re not just running—you are the power source! Use your energy to plug into awesome vehicles like cars, speedboats, and motorcycles, or use your raw power to smash through massive brick walls! 🧱🏍️\\u003cbr\\u003eCareful though! Powering these obstacles drains your energy and makes you shrink. You\\u0026#39;ll need to keep collecting batteries to stay in the race!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 SMASH YOUR RIVALS!\\u003cbr\\u003eSize matters in Plug Runner! If you are bigger and stronger than your opponents, bump into them to knock them down! 🥊 They will stay on the ground for a few seconds and drop special Black Batteries that anyone can collect for a massive power boost. Show no mercy!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏁 BE THE FIRST TO FINISH!\\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s a thrilling dash to the end. Power through the obstacles, manage your energy wisely, outsmart your rivals, and be the first to cross the finish line to claim the crown! 👑\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ GAME FEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Simple \\u0026amp; Addictive: Easy one-finger swipe controls, perfect for everyone!\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Vibrant 3D Graphics: Colorful paths, satisfying animations, and dynamic gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e🚗 Epic Power-Ups: Steer boats, ride bikes, and break walls!\\u003cbr\\u003e🥊 Fun Combat Mechanic: Knock down smaller players and steal their energy.\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Endless Racing Fun: Multiple levels with different challenges to test your skills!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you fully charged and ready to run? ⚡ Download Plug Runner NOW and electrify the competition! 🔌🏁\"],\"AbbaYosua.Design\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8Mp8IMSw2z47-vf8UwqDBzzbgRXX5TzEg_hLcrjnioOWWAn83F73IYhhldW_VO8PfKlvM2-pHrOlnZm7UWRX\"],null,[222,200,87,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"เหมาะสมสำหรับทุกกลุ่มอายุ มีความรุนแรงได้เล็กน้อยในบริบทที่ตลกขบขันหรือแฟนตาซี ห้ามไม่ให้มีภาษาที่หยาบคาย\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.plug.runner.battery