y2bWvapbdFw\"]]],\"Camo Hunt: Sniper Spy\",[\"4.5\",4.485207],\"เล่นฆ่าเวลา\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.an.camo.hunt.sniper.spy\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.an.camo.hunt.sniper.spy\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.an.camo.hunt.sniper.spy\"]],[\"qgJoGmYIS0oTCMOWlLDHkJcDFZ3ncwEd2QAY9PoBDAoKCAASBgoCdGgQAboCPQohChtjb20uYW4uY2Ftby5odW50LnNuaXBlci5zcHkQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"nhv1oIs99A0\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:nhv1oIs99A0?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:nhv1oIs99A0\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezk-aqkjq1b2RqbIOVfO9vPlHyvOMIw6SIncuFW81wAJElMT0s7sbgP9wBF44C4FSljidIM3lhjZcs4arW2pL9vbe9jLXZq5ZmlnLQ59WFqc1hSO_ZsVcDryF4gry4b9RYKZ_aqqTZq56i4p4R6zEPgZOApzkfBo4NHAfivpX28kSsAigEXZyUkLbA7X_8wGYGHYfVKTEkzUnHlr1KFCxXaiH6IXKXyfTEX8BPOoxn5RO567SMfYhiWpsw_00CNiwdkSqcJF6sLkM8NzPxKAI-pS9axaKQZ8GwUhQn171qyczQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nhv1oIs99A0/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Become the ultimate sniper in Camo Hunt: Sniper Spy, where you become a skilled assassin trying to hunt down all the camouflaged targets. You will find yourself facing numerous challenges throughout your mission as your targets can blend perfectly into their surroundings. Be careful where you shoot, sharpen your strategic skills and precision, because your bullets are not unlimited!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e• Camo Targets: Hunt down targets that use camouflage to blend into the environment. Their color and shape can be very flexible, making them nearly invisible, adding to the challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Strategic Gameplay: Plan your shot carefully. Use hints to locate hidden targets and make every shot count.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Immersive Environments: Explore diverse and realistic environments where every detail matters. Stay alert and adapt to the changing landscapes.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Challenging Missions: Complete a series of missions that test your precision and patience. Each level brings new challenges and tougher targets.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow to Play:\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Scan the Environment: Use your sharp observation skills to scan the environment for camouflaged targets.\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Take the Shot: Once you’ve located your target, aim carefully and take the shot. Precision is key!\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Use Hints: If you’re having trouble finding a target, use hints to get clues about their location.\\u003cbr\\u003e4. Complete the Mission: Successfully eliminate all targets to complete the mission and move on to the next challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready to prove that you have what it takes to be the best assassin? Try Camo Hunt: Sniper Spy now and make your shot!\"],\"TVC Global., Ltd\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mztDgc9Hj_Icg4oJq619aTxk79rGoW4qBFGI2QKNy1fgZUV4_gpoX0euG50zyc6-44wMxndPbeSKlxqTpvYMUDw\"],null,[17,20,24,255]],null,[\"ประเภท 16+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/djaflVB_tFGRjZlfs-xrcdSPeI_CUG3TTewlYuSFjq1tsNXxb4aZqAq0uMFzUtiZI_R65RtDyr4Zt2vt\"]],[null,\"ความรุนแรงมาก\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eดูข้อมูลเพิ่มเติม\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UAlGNLgnQRVs-XrK_mUGJw1h_nlO1Ykv0jZK-YoRrRYIGIWmRdE_CCPB7U34jAiz4xLWUAqQ5Me7Daq7N_8\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"THB\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"ซื้อ\"],null,1,[null,null,null,nul