,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.puppet.bang.stress.relieve\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.puppet.bang.stress.relieve\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.puppet.bang.stress.relieve\"]],[\"qgJrGmkIUUoTCMOWlLDHkJcDFZ3ncwEd2QAY9PoBDAoKCAASBgoCdGgQAboCQAokCh5jb20ucHVwcGV0LmJhbmcuc3RyZXNzLnJlbGlldmUQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Had a long, rough day? Boss giving you a hard time?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePuppet Bang! 2is back with an even bigger, badder, and more satisfying smashing experience!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into the ultimate ragdoll sandbox where rules don\\u0026#39;t exist and the helpless wooden puppet is your personal punching bag. Release your anger, relieve your stress, and indulge in pure, unfiltered chaos!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 What’s New in Puppet Bang! 2?\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 Upgraded Ragdoll Physics\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience hyper-realistic feedback! Feel every impact with improved ragdoll physics, snapping joints, and dramatic flying debris for maximum visual satisfaction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🛠️ Massive Arsenal of Weapons\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom classic baseball bats and boxing gloves to explosive Gatling guns, thunder hammers, and sci-fi lasers! Unlock dozens of crazy tools and combine them for ultimate destruction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Custom Dummy Skins\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMake it personal! Dress up your puppet in hilarious outfits—turn it into a stressed office worker, a goofy clown, or a high-tech cyborg before you knock its socks off.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎧 Immersive Sound \\u0026amp; Impact Effects\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeel the crunch with high-fidelity 3D impact sounds, hilarious puppet screams, and satisfying destruction audio. 